1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:05,875
And in the end, a tool that guides public money should be judged on what it admits it cannot see.

2
00:00:05,825 --> 00:00:14,637
CoolSpend cannot see buried pipes or exact sidewalk widths, so every in-ground slot is flagged for a pre-dig survey, never assumed clear.

3
00:00:14,637 --> 00:00:18,112
Its six-metre setback is deliberately cautious.

4
00:00:18,112 --> 00:00:24,050
Its shade-gain is only a placement guide; the cooling number always comes from the live simulation.

5
00:00:24,050 --> 00:00:31,275
It leaves one hundred thousand of a million euros uncommitted by design, and it speaks for one city, one July.

6
00:00:31,275 --> 00:00:33,550
That honesty is the point.

7
00:00:33,550 --> 00:00:36,987
Trust is earned through fidelity, not novelty.

